      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=120%><b><color=#FFFFFF>SELECT LOCATION</color></b></size>\r\n\r\n<size=80%><i><color=#AAAAAA>Choose
    your hunting ground carefully.</color></i></size>\r\n\r\n<color=#555555>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</color>\r\n<size=105%><b><color=#66CCFF>AIRPORT</color></b></size>\r\n<color=#CCCCCC>\r\nBright
    terminals and constant movement.\r\n\r\nTravelers rush between gates, leaving
    little room to hide.\n\r\nEvery action is visible.\r\n\r\nSecurity awareness
    is high.\r\n<color=#FF4444>Suspicion rises quickly if you stand out.</color>\r\n</color><size=80%><color=#AAAAAA></color>\r\n<color=#555555>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</color>\r\n\r\n<size=105%><b><color=#FFCC66>TEMPLE</color></b></size>\r\n\r\n<color=#CCCCCC>\r\nQuiet
    halls and narrow pathways.\r\n\r\nShadows and structures offer places to hide
    and strike unseen.\n\r\nMovement is slower, but more deliberate.\r\n\r\n<color=#FF4444>Sound
    carries. A single mistake can reveal you.</color>\r\n</color>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
